        "value": "<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_11 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_14\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_16  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_13  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><strong>Update 11.30am: </strong>We&#8217;ve identified the issue, and the estimated time to repair is 5 pm on 2 June 2026.<strong><br /></strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong>Original post:</strong> We&#8217;re aware of an outage impacting the Auckland region, which is localised in the Mt Roskill area.</p>\n<p>We&#8217;re currently investigating and will provide more information when we can.</p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/outage-impacting-the-auckland-region/\">Outage impacting the Auckland region</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
